'''Dabul of Qym''' (Bacha Dabul TBD TBD ish Zhifol; born # MONTH {{abbr|2382|1979 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]]. He is the son of [[Prince Ulir of Qym|Prince Ulir]], [[Bacha XVII of Qym|King Bacha XVII]]'s youngest brother, and, as such, is seventh in the [[line of succession to the Qymish throne]]. 

